--
N5008 [temp.dep.type]/1 + [temp.mem]: members of a member class
template of a class template may use the ENCLOSING template's
parameters (`N`, or `T` as an expression).  Only the innermost
instance's parameters were bound while converting a deferred member
body, so `k + N` hit an unbound template parameter and the body was
dropped ("could not fully type-check").  Covers constructor with
mem-initializer, const member with renamed parameters, and a static
member, all defined out of line with two-level headers.
